  "releaseNotes": "# AgentOS Core 2.0.0-beta.67\n\n- Restores Codex native Todo planning after the Codex CLI update, for new and resumed conversations\n- Uses the AI SDK dynamic tool-event contract for native plans without adding a second executor or changing approvals\n- Preserves complete long plans in streaming events and reloaded conversation history\n- Fixes same-turn progress recovery, explicit plan clearing and failed-clear visibility\n- Keeps long Todo lists within the viewport with internal scrolling, keyboard dismissal and consistent light/dark themes\n- Prevents garbage collection from prematurely cancelling streamed model responses, retaining backpressure, cancellation and error propagation\n- Uses AgentOS Runtime 1.0.0-beta.28 with the corrected Codex bridge and model Gateway; Codex/OpenCode CLI pins and document dependencies remain unchanged\n- Retains configuration, credentials, conversations, attachments, Skills and durable workspaces\n\nSource: `af9fb399936400394c302231b67ac3cea9adead5`\n\nCore: macOS arm64, Linux x64 and Linux arm64 (GLIBC 2.28+)\nRuntime: macOS arm64, Linux amd64/arm64, Cube Linux amd64/arm64\n\nThis is a beta release",
